    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1111">

                <pb facs="0805" n="689" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg689"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.48/1857.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Canada to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Vera Cruz</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-09-22">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 22, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Shall we repatriate John Keller with family of seven and other destitute
                    Americans soliciting free transportation to United States and who had ample
                    opportunity during time Department maintained chartered ships but refused to
                    go?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Canada</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
